deft toml - commands (input -> output)
  convert   toml -> data       Change format: --to json|yaml|xml|jsonl
  diff      toml... -> report  Compare two files by structure
  format    toml -> toml       Tidy a file: --sort-keys
  merge     toml... -> toml    Deep-merge files; later files win
  validate  toml -> report     Check syntax, or a JSON Schema with --schema
More: deft toml <command> --help
